{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415487","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415487","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1041548701:1":{"text":"데이먼이 또 어디로 간 거지? 얘가 정말 걱정만 끼치고...","source_cn":"戴蒙又跑到哪里去了？这孩子，真让人担心……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56F2B27646554E39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041548702:1":{"text":"아이를 찾고 있어?","source_cn":"你在找你的孩子吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC560EAC560CCE75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041548703:1":{"text":"혹시 몸에 붕대를 감고 있는 남자아이 본 적 있어?","source_cn":"你看到一个身上缠着绷带的小男孩了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84903DBC7230F466","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041548704:1":{"text":"솔직히 말하면, 본 적 없어.","source_cn":"老实说，没有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6B77201EBE164DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041548705:1":{"text":"그럼 너랑은 상관 없는 일이겠네.","source_cn":"那这与你无关。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19BDC9B5DB32F7CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041548706:1":{"text":"알아, 알아. 아이들은 다 그렇게 장난이 심하지.","source_cn":"我明白我明白，孩子们就是如此淘气。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB05BE5BCE5347D61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041548707:1":{"text":"나도 아이가 있어서 그 기분을 잘 알아.","source_cn":"我也有孩子，太能理解你的心情了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB67399CB7D4E557E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041548708:1":{"text":"아이...?","source_cn":"你的孩子……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09A93968294DAC80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041548709:1":{"text":"장난기 많은 미어캣이야. 항상 사고를 치고 사람을 물기도 하지. 지금은 몰래 어디로 놀러 갔는지 보이지도 않고 말이야.","source_cn":"一只调皮的小狐獴，总是闯祸，还咬人呢，现在也不知道偷跑...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C2B874A0214926B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041548710:1":{"text":"그래서 지금 네가 왜 이렇게 초조해하는지 이해해. 그러니 나한테 이야기해 봐.","source_cn":"所以我很能理解你的焦急，可以跟我说说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEC0D8BB34028288","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041548711:1":{"text":"...난 지금 내 아들 데이먼을 찾고 있어. 눈 깜짝할 사이에 사라진 걸 보니 또 어딘가로 놀러 가버린 것 같네.","source_cn":"……我在找我的儿子戴蒙，我一转头他就不见了，估计是又跑...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF22F6DD13D126163","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041548712:1":{"text":"이 녀석, 적어도 나가기 전에 얘기는 해줘야지.","source_cn":"这孩子，至少应该在出门前先跟我说一声啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x088560D121941996","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041548713:1":{"text":"알지, 알지. 꼬마 녀석들이 아무 말도 없이 사라지니 걱정되지.","source_cn":"我懂我懂，小家伙们一声不吱就消失实在不让人放心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x375A745D75B06965","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041548714:1":{"text":"그렇다면 넌 경험이 풍부한 부모겠네? 너의 조언을 들어보는 것도 나쁘지 않을 것 같아...","source_cn":"那么，你是位经验丰富的家长了？或许我可以听听你的建议……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x525A3A6230837C7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:雪米拉":{"text":"세미라","source":"雪米拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿熏":{"text":"스모키","source":"阿熏","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":2}}